  "scope": "Constructed coupled integer absorber parameters, source palette budgets and divisibilities; exact original-copy reservation, arbitrary-reserve bipartite packing, complete exterior-class completion, exact simple regular remainder, and actual balanced orientation. ReservedRemainder composes these graph steps from an original regular host and explicit reserved copies with a supplied compressed balanced exterior coloring. The geometric spanning setup, special path systems, robust absorber, construction of those stage inputs, and final whole-host factorization remain unproved. No numbered assertion is added.",
